# Phase 62 Wave 3 — caret rendering coverage for DROP error paths.
#
# DROP SEMANTIC VIEW with no name matches no grammar production, so DuckDB
# reports its own syntax error with a caret at the `;` where the name belongs.
#
# Behavioural property pinned (from RESEARCH.md §6):
#   B7: caret renders for DROP errors (missing name)

require semantic_views

statement ok
LOAD semantic_views;

# B7: DROP without name -- a syntax error at the missing name, with caret
statement error
DROP SEMANTIC VIEW;
----
syntax error at or near ";"

# Caret rendering is also pinned via the LINE 1: prefix.
statement error
DROP SEMANTIC VIEW;
----
LINE 1:
